---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';

const navLinks = [
  { name: "Berita Crypto", url: "/crypto" },
  { name: "Analisis RWA", url: "/rwa" },
  { name: "Tim Editorial", url: "/team" },
  { name: "Tentang Kami", url: "/about" },
  { name: "Kebijakan Privasi", url: "/privacy-policy" },
  { name: "Disclaimer", url: "/disclaimer" }
];
---

<footer class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-300 py-16 px-4 border-t-4 border-red-600">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
    
    <!-- Bagian 1: Tentang RWADaily -->
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-4">Tentang RWADaily</h3>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
        RWADaily adalah portal berita terdepan yang berfokus pada Real World Assets (RWA) dan ekosistem crypto. Kami berkomitmen memberikan analisis mendalam bagi investor cerdas.
      </p>
      
      <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-6">
        <p class="font-semibold text-gray-300">Kantor Redaksi:</p>
        <p>Plaza Asia, Jl. K.H.Z. Mustofa No. 326,<br/> Tasikmalaya, Jawa Barat 46126, Indonesia.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Ikon Media Sosial RWADaily -->
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rwadailybiz/" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-label="LinkedIn">
          <Icon name="mdi:linkedin" class="w-6 h-6" />
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/rwaspot" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-label="Instagram">
          <Icon name="mdi:instagram" class="w-6 h-6" />
        </a>
        <a href="https://x.com/Rwadailybiz" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-label="X (Twitter)">
          <Icon name="mdi:twitter" class="w-6 h-6" />
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/share/1HoCmT2TS1/" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-label="Facebook">
          <Icon name="mdi:facebook" class="w-6 h-6" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bagian 2: Pintasan -->
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-4">Pintasan</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
        {navLinks.map((link) => (
          <li>
            <a href={link.url} class="hover:text-red-500 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
              <Icon name="mdi:chevron-right" class="w-4 h-4"/> {link.name}
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Bagian 3: Banner Kolaborasi -->
    <div class="bg-red-900/20 p-6 rounded-xl border border-red-900/50 flex flex-col justify-center">
      <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-2">Ingin Berkolaborasi?</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-4">Bergabunglah dengan tim kami atau kirimkan berita menarik seputar RWA dan Crypto.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="text-sm text-red-400 hover:text-white font-semibold transition">Hubungi Kami →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Copyright -->
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-gray-800 text-center text-xs text-gray-500 px-4">
    <p class="mb-2">© {new Date().getFullYear()} RWADaily — All rights reserved.</p>
    <p>Investasi di bidang crypto memiliki risiko tinggi. Lakukan riset mandiri.</p>
  </div>
</footer>